---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Thank you — Sealshot"
  description="Your Sealshot license is on its way by email."
  noindex
>
  <section class="section wrap" aria-labelledby="thanks-title">
    <p class="kicker">Thank you</p>
    <h1 id="thanks-title">Your license is on its way</h1>
    <p class="sub">
      It arrives by email within a minute or two, as a file attachment. The
      email address is the one you used at checkout.
    </p>

    <div class="thanks-card">
      <h2>To activate</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Open the attached <code>.sealshotlicense</code> file — Sealshot picks it up automatically.</li>
        <li>Or open Sealshot, go to <strong>Settings ▸ License</strong>, and drag the file onto the window.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="muted">
        Keep the file. It's your proof of purchase, and it's what you'll use if
        you move to a new Mac or reinstall.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="thanks-card quiet">
      <h2>Not there yet?</h2>
      <p>
        Check your spam folder first — a message with an attachment from a new
        sender often lands there.
      </p>
      <p>
        If it still hasn't arrived after ten minutes, email
        <a href="mailto:support@seal-shot.com">support@seal-shot.com</a> and
        we'll send it again. Your purchase is recorded either way, so nothing is
        lost.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/docs/quickstart/install/">Read the quickstart</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .thanks-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    background: var(--surface-band);
  }
  .thanks-card.quiet { background: var(--surface-page); }
  .thanks-card h2 { margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: 1.125rem; }
  .thanks-card ol { margin: 0 0 0.75rem; padding-left: 1.25rem; }
  .thanks-card li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .muted { color: var(--slate-600); margin-bottom: 0; }
</style>
